  "content": "\n\nIcarus 是一個小型模組，新增了多種色彩繽紛且獨特的翅膀，可裝備於後背（Curios）或披風（Trinkets）欄位。\n\n這些翅膀只有兩個缺點：飛行時會消耗飢餓值，且裝備盔甲時最大速度會降低。穿戴的盔甲越多，減速效果越明顯，最多會降至正常最大速度的 2/3（可設定）。此外，還有一個標籤，可透過數據包將翅膀加入其中，使它們在飛行時不會消耗飢餓值。\n\n# 來看看由 [Zeddy](https://www.youtube.com/@zeddyminecraft) 製作的精彩展示影片：\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/yTYI6g2g07E\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n# 全新的耐力系統！\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/kyCy4u1pbSw\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n---\n\n### 合成配方：\n![合成配方](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/723db6c848c7302197286a87aa3f3b12f178ac52.png)\n\n---\n\n<table align=\"center\">\n    <tr>\n        <th><b>加入我的 Discord</b></th>\n        <th><b>支持我的 Ko-fi！</b></th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <th><a href=\"https://cammiescorner.dev/discord\"><img src=\"https://cammiescorner.dev/images/extras/discord.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" title=\"Cammie's Corner Discord\" alt=\"Cammie's Corner Discord\"></a></th>\n        <th><a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/camellias/tiers\"><img src=\"https://cammiescorner.dev/images/extras/kofi.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" title=\"Cammie's Corner Patreon\" alt=\"Cammie's Corner Patreon\"></a></th>\n    </tr>\n</table>",
